= many prominent right-wing members split

That scheming snake, Erhard Jakobsen, has engineered a split to form a new party! Our policy choices have greatly offended many of our right wing 'comrades' who have now shown their true colours and followed Erhard, these traitors have taken to call them selves the 'Center-Democrats', or 'CD'. A ridiculous name.

On a positive note this has scraped off a good chunk of our most uppity right-wing members.

